 broadcast through the Naver V App as a pilot episode. The show starring Seo Jang Hoon, Jo Se Ho, Ahn Jung Hwan, Yoo Byung Jae, Kim Min Suk and BTS' member, Jungkook. According to the report, \"Flower Crew\" will take the six cast members on a three-day adventure in which all their decisions will be made by viewers of the show. Viewers will have the chance to participate in the show through Naver V live broadcast voting.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":4}],"value":4,"age":"NC-17"},"background_color":"","current_season_id":24302,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}